## Pricing and free plan

Every plan includes the full platform (Analytics, Session Replay, Experimentation, Guides and Surveys, Activation, and Amplitude AI) and unlimited seats. Usage is measured by event volume, not monthly tracked users (MTUs).

- **Free** — $0, no credit card, no time limit. 2 million events per month, 10,000 monthly session replays, unlimited feature flags, AI Agents and MCP. Not a trial.
- **Plus** — starts at $0; the first 2 million events per month are free, then pricing scales with event volume up to 70 million events per month. Adds custom events and formulas, behavioral cohorts, alerts, heatmaps, and 2-year data retention.
- **Growth** and **Enterprise** — custom, event-based pricing for larger teams, with higher limits and advanced governance, security, and support.
- **Startups** — companies with under $10M in funding and fewer than 20 employees can get one free year of the Growth plan: [https://amplitude.com/startups](https://amplitude.com/startups.md)
- Full plan comparison and pricing FAQ: [https://amplitude.com/pricing](https://amplitude.com/pricing.md)

